Firmware built from this repository can contain code from other projects.
Modules that vendor code keep it under their own third_party/ folder and
list it in a NOTICE of their own:

  modules/jpegio/NOTICE   TJpgDec (ChaN) and stb_image_write's JPEG writer

The tflite and vision modules compile code fetched at build time from
esp-vision, at the commit pinned in modules/.esp-vision/ESP_VISION.lock.
Nothing from it is stored in this repository, but firmware built with
either module contains it:

esp-vision
  https://github.com/espressif/esp-vision
  Copyright 2026 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD
  Apache License 2.0, https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  tflite compiles modules/py_tflite.cpp; vision compiles its image stack,
  platform layer and Python modules.

  It carries, and vision compiles:
  - imlib, from OpenMV, Copyright (C) 2013-2024 OpenMV, LLC. MIT License.
  - AprilTag (imlib's apriltag.c), Copyright (C) 2013-2016 The Regents of
    The University of Michigan. BSD 2-Clause License.

TensorFlow Lite Micro
  https://github.com/tensorflow/tflite-micro, through Espressif's
  esp-tflite-micro ESP-IDF component (modules/tflite/components/tflite_micro)
  Copyright The TensorFlow Authors. Apache License 2.0.

The ESP-IDF components these modules require through idf_component.yml are
downloaded by ESP-IDF's component manager and carry their own licenses.

